      "content": "SP 8607 10/273 21/12/67 WENDOVER POUND STREET north side No.18 GV II House. C17 with early C19 front altered painted stucco. Old tile roof with central and RH end chimneys. 2-storeys, 3 bays of wooden leaded upper casements, 3-light to outer bays, 2-light to centre. C20 canted bay window with tiled roof to RH of ground floor 3 casements to LH side. Interior said to have had bracket carved with date 1621. RCHM I p.306 MON.6. Listing NGR: SP8668107711"
